{"id":"level-up-2026-10-27","name":"2026-10-27 每日卡片","project":"level-up-cards","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/aha-moment-art/level-up-cards/tree/5fe1e82100e36ff24691128b840751378978fb45","sentences":[{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1951","en":"The survey measured the prevalence of cycling among local commuters.","zh":"调查测量了骑自行车在当地通勤者中的普及程度。","note":"prevalence · 普及， 流行， 盛行 · the prevalence of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1952","en":"The garden contains only plants native to this coastal region.","zh":"花园里只有这个沿海地区的本地植物。","note":"native · 当地的；本地人， 本国人 · native plants","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1953","en":"The coach gave a motivational talk before the final match.","zh":"决赛前，教练作了一番鼓舞士气的讲话。","note":"motivational · 动机的， 有关动机的 · a motivational talk","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1954","en":"The archive revealed hitherto unknown details about the artist's early life.","zh":"档案揭示了有关这位艺术家早年生活的此前未知细节。","note":"hitherto · 到目前为止， 迄今 · hitherto unknown","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1955","en":"The violence of the storm surprised even experienced sailors.","zh":"风暴之猛烈让经验丰富的水手也感到惊讶。","note":"violence · 暴力行为； 激烈， 猛烈 · the violence of","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1956","en":"The longer opening hours had an unintended consequence: higher electricity bills.","zh":"延长开放时间产生了一个意外后果：电费增加。","note":"consequence · 后果 · an unintended consequence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1957","en":"The robust design makes this chair suitable for busy classrooms.","zh":"结实的设计使这把椅子适合在繁忙的教室使用。","note":"robust · 健壮的， 强壮的； 坚定的 · a robust design","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1958","en":"The map was particularly useful when the road signs disappeared.","zh":"道路标牌看不到时，这张地图格外有用。","note":"particularly · 特别， 尤其 · particularly useful","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1959","en":"Tourism now plays a dominant role in the island's economy.","zh":"旅游业如今在岛屿经济中占据主导地位。","note":"dominant · 占优势的； 统治的； 居高临下的 · a dominant role","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1960","en":"One disappointing result should not devalue years of careful work.","zh":"一次令人失望的结果不应贬低多年细致工作的价值。","note":"devalue · 使贬值； 贬低 · devalue an achievement","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1961","en":"Passengers began to jostle for space near the train doors.","zh":"乘客们开始在车门附近推挤着争位置。","note":"jostle · 推挤； 挤开通路 · jostle for space","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1962","en":"We used a decibel meter to compare noise levels.","zh":"我们用分贝计比较了噪声水平。","note":"decibel · 分贝 · a decibel meter","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1963","en":"Poorly planned construction can disfigure an otherwise beautiful landscape.","zh":"规划不良的建设可能毁掉原本美丽的景观。","note":"disfigure · 使毁容， 使变丑 · disfigure a landscape","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1964","en":"The lecture examined links between consumption and resource depletion.","zh":"讲座探讨了消费与资源消耗之间的联系。","note":"depletion · 削减； 消耗 · resource depletion","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1965","en":"Signs prohibit entry to the worksite without prior permission.","zh":"标牌禁止未经事先许可进入工地。","note":"prohibit · 禁止， 阻止 · prohibit entry","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1966","en":"A quiet working environment can conduce to more careful thinking.","zh":"安静的工作环境有助于更周密的思考。","note":"conduce · 有益于， 有助于； 导致 · conduce to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1967","en":"A small aeroplane flew low over the coastal fields.","zh":"一架小飞机低飞掠过海岸边的田野。","note":"aeroplane · 飞机 · a small aeroplane","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1968","en":"We did not foresee the problems caused by the narrow entrance.","zh":"我们没有预见到狭窄入口带来的问题。","note":"foresee · 预见， 预知 · foresee a problem","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1969","en":"Many visitors associate this town with its famous pottery.","zh":"许多游客把这个镇与它著名的陶器联系起来。","note":"associate · 使联合； 使有联系； 交往；副的； 联合的， 合伙的；伙伴；同事 · associate with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1970","en":"The restorer paid scrupulous attention to every damaged detail.","zh":"修复师一丝不苟地关注每一处受损细节。","note":"scrupulous · 多顾虑的， 谨慎的； 一丝不苟的， 严谨的 · scrupulous attention","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1971","en":"The textbook includes a labelled diagram of a human kidney.","zh":"教科书中有一幅带标注的人体肾脏示意图。","note":"kidney · 肾， 肾脏 · a kidney diagram","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1972","en":"A gleam of light appeared through the distant trees.","zh":"远处的树林间出现了一线亮光。","note":"gleam · 闪烁；流露；闪光 · a gleam of light","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1973","en":"The noisy surroundings did not detract from the quality of the performance.","zh":"嘈杂的环境并未影响这场演出的精彩程度。","note":"detract · 去掉， 减损 · detract from","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1974","en":"Her sound judgment helped us avoid an unnecessary expense.","zh":"她明智的判断帮助我们避免了一笔不必要的开销。","note":"judgment · 意见； 审判； 判断 · sound judgment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1975","en":"The exhibition donated its ticket proceeds to a local charity.","zh":"展览把门票收入捐给了一家当地慈善机构。","note":"charity · 慈善； 施舍； 慈善机构 · a local charity","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1976","en":"The book is a useful compendium of traditional woodworking techniques.","zh":"这本书是一本实用的传统木工技法汇编。","note":"compendium · 简要， 概略 · a useful compendium","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1977","en":"We keep spare office stationery in the cupboard beside reception.","zh":"我们把备用办公文具放在前台旁的柜子里。","note":"stationery · 文具 · office stationery","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1978","en":"The collection includes a rare mineral found in local mines.","zh":"这批藏品包含一种在当地矿山发现的稀有矿物。","note":"mineral · 矿物， 矿石 · a rare mineral","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1979","en":"The blue notebooks are currently out of stock.","zh":"蓝色笔记本目前缺货。","note":"stock · 储备；常备的；储备品；股票；〈总称〉家畜 · out of stock","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1980","en":"The unexpected result requires independent verification before publication.","zh":"这个意外结果需要经过独立核实后才能发表。","note":"verification · 确认 · independent verification","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1981","en":"The company will suspend the ferry service during essential repairs.","zh":"公司将在必要维修期间暂停渡轮服务。","note":"suspend · 吊， 悬挂； 推迟； 暂停， 中止 · suspend a service","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1982","en":"The divers found broken pottery beneath the sandy surface.","zh":"潜水员在沙质表层之下发现了陶器碎片。","note":"beneath · 在下方 · beneath the surface","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1983","en":"Would you like to swap seats for a better view?","zh":"你想换个座位，以便看得更清楚吗？","note":"swap · 交换 · swap seats","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1984","en":"The hot weather caused a surge in demand for fans.","zh":"炎热天气使电风扇需求猛增。","note":"surge · 蜂拥而出；波动，涌动；洋溢； 猛增 · a surge in demand","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1985","en":"Making tea became a quiet daily ritual before work.","zh":"沏茶成了上班前每天安静的例行活动。","note":"ritual · 典礼，仪式；例行公事， · a daily ritual","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1986","en":"The machine can dispense hot or cold drinking water.","zh":"这台机器可以提供热饮用水或冷饮用水。","note":"dispense · 分发， 分配； 提供 · dispense water","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1987","en":"The volunteers check the walking paths on a regular basis.","zh":"志愿者们定期检查步行道路。","note":"basis · 基础； 根据； 原则 · on a regular basis","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1988","en":"A private tutor helped him prepare for the entrance examination.","zh":"一位私人教师帮助他准备入学考试。","note":"tutor · 家庭教师，私人教师；给…当家庭教师；指导 · a private tutor","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1989","en":"The sunny weather may tempt us to extend our walk.","zh":"晴朗的天气可能让我们想多走一会儿。","note":"tempt · 引诱； 吸引 · tempt someone to","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1990","en":"The training session used fictional examples of clinical assessments.","zh":"这次培训使用了临床评估的虚构案例。","note":"clinical · 临床的； 冷静客观的； 简朴的， 不装饰的 · a clinical assessment","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1991","en":"They hoped to reciprocate our kindness by inviting us to dinner.","zh":"他们希望邀请我们吃饭，以回报我们的好意。","note":"reciprocate · 回报， 回应； 报答 · reciprocate kindness","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1992","en":"Twist the two coloured threads together before tying the knot.","zh":"打结前，先把两根彩线捻在一起。","note":"twist · 缠绕；捻；扭曲，弯曲；弯曲 · twist together","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1993","en":"The forthcoming exhibition will feature photographs of the changing coastline.","zh":"即将举办的展览将展出海岸线变迁的照片。","note":"forthcoming · 即将到来的 · a forthcoming exhibition","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1994","en":"The unusual pattern continued to perplex even experienced observers.","zh":"这种异常图案仍让经验丰富的观察者感到困惑。","note":"perplex · 使困惑； 使复杂化 · perplex an observer","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1995","en":"A large boulder blocked the narrow path beside the stream.","zh":"一块巨石堵住了溪流旁的狭窄小路。","note":"boulder · 大石头； 鹅卵石 · a large boulder","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1996","en":"I tend to procrastinate over paperwork until the deadline approaches.","zh":"我总是把文书工作拖到截止日期临近。","note":"procrastinate · 耽搁， 拖延 · procrastinate over","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1997","en":"The archivist helped us locate the document in an old catalogue.","zh":"档案员帮助我们在旧目录中找到了那份文件。","note":"locate · 找到； 位于； 使坐落于； 把…设置在 · locate a document","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-27:s1998","en":"The school introduced reusable containers to combat food packaging waste.","zh":"学校引入可重复使用的容器